{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-cfbde2a7ea800b79dfddcbba09be1209e22ed055c597362d","family_id":"KR:007467","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Rules on Measurement of Ship Tonnage","title_original":"선박톤수의 측정에 관한 규칙","kind":"해양수산부령","source_version":"233591","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=233591","source_sha256":"86d0a65be806f7367d84c8e503c399209a614e2ef6ffb877cf8a6bbdcaf5f140","body_sha256":"a0f16ac4f28208dfc739b7e1c2c5f816fea00c0a95c35cfb5a7abc8309ba7f9a","article_count":1,"full_text":"Article 19 (Calculation of Hull Volume of Ships with Measurement Length Less than 24 Metres)\n(1) The hull volume of a ship with a measurement length of less than 24 metres shall be calculated by the following formula:\n\n0.65 × L × B × {Dm + (2/3)C + (1/3)(Ds − Dm)}\n\nL: Measurement length.\nB: Maximum breadth between the outer surfaces of the side shell plating below the upper deck (hereinafter referred to as \"maximum breadth\"). However, for a sailing ship, where the sum of the maximum breadths at positions 25 percent and 75 percent of the measurement length aft of its forward end is not greater than 1.5 times the maximum breadth at the widest part of the hull, B is the average of the maximum breadths at those two positions.\nDm: Vertical distance at the midpoint of the measurement length from the underside of the keel (the lower edge of the keel rabbet in a wooden ship) to the underside of the upper deck at the ship's side.\nC: Height of camber at the midpoint of the measurement length.\nDs: Vertical distance at the midpoint of the measurement length from the underside of the keel (the lower edge of the keel rabbet in a wooden ship) to the line joining the forward and after ends of the measurement length.\n\n(2) For a ship having a hull portion forward of the vertical at the forward end of the measurement length or aft of the vertical at its after end, the volume of that portion shall be calculated by multiplying its maximum length by its average breadth and average depth, and shall be added to the volume under paragraph (1).\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\translations\\tonnage_rule\\en.title.json","sha256":"c897b8af8593e31fdc2f6cb0caef7bbf94c13d2953aacc9e1b32bc312a7cd2e9"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\translations\\tonnage_rule\\en.units.parts\\article-19.json","sha256":"8a05b227ec16fa384242b00890cca4f126d59c5fd4209a8f74a809fdce23fe55"},"selfcheck":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\translations\\tonnage_rule\\en.units.parts\\article-19.selfcheck.json","sha256":"2c9cb18c2f9a122656361ad5eb1b832e6ede506005d0ef1a51534c70a0e7ef95"},"text":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\translations\\tonnage_rule\\en.units.parts\\article-19.txt","sha256":"f15fbb0dd2e977e922257af3683fd479141910874b0e1e2097974ff3ef53208d"},"unit_key":"article-19"}],"body_and_addenda_complete":false,"component_id":"TONNAGE_RULE:kr-007467-233591-ko","component_ids":["TONNAGE_RULE:kr-007467-233591-ko:article-19"],"component_kind":"TONNAGE_RULE","edition_id":"edition-9f91cfaa1968ebd9b7fa7f13af55d8691a515626ff4cc9ba","frozen_scope_plan_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_